          "article": "place:Abel-keramim",
          "gloss": "Abel-Keramim",
          "description": "A village in the region of Ammon, east of the Jordan River, where Jephthah subdued the Ammonites (Judges 11:33)."
        }
      ]
    },
    "fra": {
